Page: Markets
Cat: 📈
Function: Provides live market data for all asset classes
Description: Real-time and historical prices for stocks, crypto, forex, commodities, and treasury yields. Aggregates from 50+ data providers including Finnhub, CoinGecko, Alpha Vantage, and FRED.
API: GET /api/v1/markets/*
Output: Price, change, volume, OHLCV, sparkline data
